<view class="page">
  <inline-notice id="notice" bind:ready="onNoticeReady" />

  <view class="bar">
    <view class="bar-text">{{templates.length}} 个模板</view>
    <view class="bar-action" bindtap="goEditor">空白画布</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!templates.length}}" class="empty">加载中…</view>

  <view wx:else class="list">
    <view
      class="tpl"
      wx:for="{{templates}}"
      wx:key="key"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      bindtap="useTemplate"
    >
      <!-- 真实画板缩略图：按模板的多图层结构渲染 -->
      <view class="tpl-thumb">
        <canvas
          type="2d"
          class="tpl-canvas"
          style="width: {{thumbWidth}}px; height: {{thumbHeight}}px;"
        ></canvas>
        <text class="tpl-badge {{item.source === 'builtin' ? '' : 'mine'}}">
          {{item.source === 'builtin' ? '内置' : '我的'}}
        </text>
        <view class="tpl-count">{{item.layerCount}} 层</view>
      </view>

      <view class="tpl-main">
        <view class="tpl-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="tpl-desc">{{item.description}}</view>

        <view class="layer-tags">
          <text wx:if="{{item.stat.text}}" class="layer-tag text">文字 {{item.stat.text}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.stat.image}}" class="layer-tag image">贴图 {{item.stat.image}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.stat.sticker}}" class="layer-tag sticker">贴纸 {{item.stat.sticker}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.stat.seal}}" class="layer-tag seal">印章 {{item.stat.seal}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{!item.stat.text && !item.stat.image && !item.stat.sticker && !item.stat.seal}}" class="layer-tag none">纯图形</text>
        </view>

        <view class="tpl-meta-text">{{item.summary}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="tpl-ops">
        <view class="op use" data-key="{{item.key}}" catchtap="useTemplate">使用</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.source !== 'builtin'}}" class="op del" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="remove">删除</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    每个模板都是一块多图层画板：文字层可改文案、字号、颜色与字体，贴图层可换素材，贴纸层可调色缩放与旋转。
  </view>
</view>